        "id": 1132673
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-05-18T08:44:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks, I now understand. Then I suggest renaming this to `bootclasspath_library` (or similar) to clearly denote that this java_sdk_library is not actually a shared library, but a library that is (should be?) added to the bootclasspath. Then my worries about the default being true would be resolved.",
      "parentUuid": "9a05b319_ccccd5d6",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 507,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 512,
        "endChar": 21
      },
      "revId": "e46500456163f49d4dd1822b80b861149343dd77",
